<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Feb 13.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Feb 13.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali chaired a cabinet meeting on merchandise transport. Recommended liberalisation of the import of vehicles used in international transport.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- 26 foreign airlines have regular flights to and from Tunisia.</p>
<p>- Saudi Arabian Health Minister expected in Tunis on March 11.</p>
</text>
